{% extends 'corporate/pages/layout.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}{{ parent() }}{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
    {{ include('communication/partials/_boiler_plate.html.twig', {
        boilerPlates: {
            50: "<p>Alvest Arabia Equipment Services (AAES) is a Saudi-French joint venture providing advanced GSE maintenance and engineering solutions across 29 Saudi airports. Servicing 12,000+ units, AAES enhances efficiency, safety, and sustainability, delivering reliable equipment and asset management through expert teams and a client-focused approach aligned with global aviation standards.</p>",
            150: "<p>Alvest Arabia Equipment Services (AAES), a Saudi-French joint venture established in late 2020 between Saudi Ground Services (SGS) and France’s ALVEST Group, provides world-class maintenance and engineering solutions for Ground Support Equipment (GSE) across 29 Saudi airports. Servicing over 12,000 equipment, AAES leverages advanced systems like EAM and CMMS to manage tens of thousands of maintenance orders annually. The company leads the GSE digitalization movement, having completed the world’s largest project of its kind with over 2,000 On-Board Units (OBUs) installed, enhancing operational efficiency and safety. With a strong logistics network and expert-certified teams, AAES integrates Industry 4.0 technologies, data analytics, to drive innovation. Committed to excellence, AAES ensures seamless and reliable GSE operations through a client-focused approach and international standards.</p>",
            300: "<p>Alvest Arabia Equipment Services Company (AAES) is a Saudi-French Joint Venture, founded in Q4 2020 between Saudi Ground Services Company (SGS), the leading ground handling company in Saudi Arabia, and ALVEST GROUP, the French group dedicated to the design, manufacture and distribution of technical products for the aviation industry, which include aviation ground support equipment, spare parts and services.</p>
                <p>AAES stands out as a premier provider of maintenance and engineering solutions for the Ground Support Equipment (GSE). We bring international standards and expertise to our work, servicing more than 12,000 equipment across 29 airports in Saudi Arabia. Our robust operational structure integrates advanced systems like Enterprise Asset Management (EAM) and Computerized Maintenance Management Systems (CMMS). With a wealth of experience, we effectively handle tens of thousands of maintenance orders each year. Our well-coordinated logistics network, bolstered by strategically placed warehouses, ensures swift responses and uninterrupted service.</p>
                <p>AAES plays a pivotal role in transforming the aviation industry in Saudi Arabia through our innovative GSE digitalization initiative. We are proud to have successfully completed the world's largest GSE digitalization project, ushering in a new era of efficiency and safety for the Kingdom's air travel. The Company installed over 2,000 OBUs (On-Board Units) on various types of GSE, enabling real-time data collection, monitoring, and analysis. The digitalization project has significantly improved operational efficiency and enhanced safety across all Saudi airports.</p>
                <p>AAES is proud to have many Certified Leaders and Professionals in Maintenance, Reliability, and Asset Management fields. Our team is creating transformation in the GSE Industry adopting new techniques and best practices coping with the IR 4.0 integrating new technologies, data analytics, and machine learning. A client-centric approach is at the core of our principles, ensuring that GSE operations for our esteemed clients run smoothly and efficiently.</p>"
        }
    }) }}
{% endblock %}